# 🚀 Smart Resume Analyzer

A **100% offline**, no-API-key resume analyzer built with Python and Streamlit. Upload your resume PDF, paste a job description, and instantly get a skill match score, gap analysis, and personalized improvement roadmap.

---

## ✨ Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| 📊 Match Score | Percentage of JD skills found in your resume |
| 🎯 Role Detection | Auto-detects job role (ML Engineer, DevOps, Backend Dev, etc.) |
| 🏷️ Skill Categorization | Skills bucketed into 10 categories (ML/AI, Cloud, Web, etc.) |
| 💪 Strength Analysis | Highlights your strongest areas and high-demand matched skills |
| ⚠️ Gap Analysis | Identifies and prioritizes missing skills by market demand |
| 📝 Resume Tips | Specific, actionable tips to improve your resume for this JD |
| 🗺️ 30-Day Roadmap | Step-by-step plan with timelines to close skill gaps |
| 📚 Learning Resources | Free + paid course recommendations per missing skill |
| 📄 PDF Export | Download a polished PDF report (with optional roadmap) |

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install streamlit PyPDF2 reportlab
```

### 2. Run the app

```bash
streamlit run resume_analyzer_no_api.py
```

### 3. Open in browser

Streamlit will open automatically at `http://localhost:8501`

