## 🔧 How It Works

```
User uploads PDF + pastes JD
        ↓
PDF text extracted (PyPDF2)
        ↓
Both texts cleaned & lowercased
        ↓
Skill keywords matched with regex (word boundaries)
        ↓
Matched / Missing / Extra skills computed
        ↓
Score = (Matched / JD Skills) × 100
        ↓
Role inferred from JD keywords
        ↓
Strengths, Gaps, Tips, Roadmap generated by rule engine
        ↓
UI rendered + PDF report generated on demand
```

---

## 📊 Scoring Logic

| Score | Verdict | Readiness |
|---|---|---|
| ≥ 75% | 🟢 Strong Fit | 85–100% Ready |
| 40–74% | ⚠️ Needs Improvement | 50–80% Ready |
| < 40% | 🔴 Not a Fit | Below 50% Ready |

